{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/29/0012356/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この赤いクマのパーカーは、\n実はお母さんが20歳くらいの時に\n着ていたものなんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母が20歳の時の服を\n娘が20歳の時に着る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか不思議な感じがするけど\n嬉しいな〜( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時をかける。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の続きで、生写真撮影の\nオフショットを...◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/29/0012356/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか着る機会のない\nチャイナドレスが着れたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/29/0012356/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウムカラー、赤と青の衣装。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偶然赤と青なだけなんだけど、\n私からしたら特別◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブとかでも着れたらいいのにな〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/29/0012356/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着物を着る機会もないので\nこの日は特別な日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃん。\nずっと待ってるよ。\n会いに行くし話も沢山聞くからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃん不足だな〜\nお鍋したいな〜お鍋。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"--------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「エル」WANIMAさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにロックでカッコいい演奏なのに\n歌詞が物凄く切なくて\nそのギャップが素敵。\n歌詞をしっかり聞いて欲しい。\n\"明日は晴れるかな\n晴れたらいいのにな\n晴れた空の下\n会えたらいいのにな\"\nコーラスちっくに歌う\nこの部分が好き。\nこの部分を繰り返して繰り返して\nその上から重ねて歌うところとか最高。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は1/30！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで「月刊エンタメ」が\n発売されます✩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソログラビア...！\n私も仕上がりが楽しみです◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}